  "notes": "{公正|こうせい} means fairness or impartiality.\n\nFORMS:\n- Noun: {公正|こうせい} (fairness)\n- Na-adjective: {公正|こうせい}な (fair)\n- Adverb: {公正|こうせい}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ (fairly)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {公正|こうせい}な⟦{競争|きょうそう}→競争：01388_kyousou⟧ (fair competition)\n- {公正|こうせい}な⟦{選挙|せんきょ}→選挙：03303_senkyo⟧ (fair election)\n- {公正|こうせい}⟦{取引|とりひき}→取引：04700_torihiki⟧ (fair trade)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{公平|こうへい}→公平：01648_kouhei⟧: fair, impartial (more common in everyday speech)\n- {公正|こうせい}: fair, just (slightly more formal/legal)",
